description:
Services and Deliverables required:
1.	To provide a very high level estimate of reimbursement in 2024/5 to support the Council&#039;s budget-setting process;
2.	To undertake data analysis and to negotiate with individual bus operators on the reimbursement parameters recommended to apply in 2024/25;
3.	To assist with preparing West Northamptonshire&#039;s concessionary travel scheme for 2024/5;
4.	To monitor returns from operators during 2024/25, and advise on out-turn against budget on a quarterly basis;
5.	To assist the Council in considering amendments to the statutory concession scheme, such as the provision of concessionary travel before 09:30;
6.	To provide ad-hoc advice as required on bus service procurement and on designing fare initiatives outside the concessionary travel scheme.
